{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 相机模式栈求值｜实现子图\n[[Camera/模式栈实现|算法说明]] · [[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|类结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机.canvas|返回主流程]]。栈索引 0 是栈顶，HeroComponent 已先仲裁有效模式。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pull",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GetCameraView 调 UpdateCameraModes，从委托取得有效 Mode Class。\n\n调用：CameraComponent::GetCameraView → UpdateCameraModes → DetermineCameraModeDelegate → Stack::PushCameraMode(Class)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "pool",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. PushCameraMode：按 Class 在实例池查找，未找到才 NewObject；栈顶同类时直接返回。\n\nPushCameraMode 用 Class 查 CameraModeInstances；仅首次 NewObject，活跃栈与实例池分离。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "contribution",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 已在栈中：可见贡献 = 自身 Weight × 上层各 (1 - Weight)；移到索引 0，用 SetBlendWeight 反解 BlendAlpha。新类从 0 进入。\n\nPushCameraMode 计算旧模式可见贡献、置顶后调用 Mode::SetBlendWeight；避免重推时画面突然跳回全权重。",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bottom",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "空栈首次入栈：栈底权重强制为 1，避免从未初始化视角开始混合。\n\n首次入栈时底层 Mode::SetBlendWeight(1)；保证 BlendStack 有完整基底。",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 243,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "update",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. UpdateStack：Mode 先 UpdateView，再按 dt/BlendTime 推进 Alpha 并套缓动函数得到 Weight。\n\nEvaluateStack → UpdateStack(dt) → 每个 Mode::UpdateCameraMode(dt)：UpdateView + BlendAlpha/缓动推进。",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 729,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "prune",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 遇到权重满 1 的上层模式：下层已不可见，调用 OnDeactivation 并移除活动项；实例池保留。\n\nUpdateStack 删去被完全遮盖的旧活跃项，实例池仍保留以供后续复用。",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 891,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "blend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. BlendStack：从数组末尾的栈底 View 开始，逐层混到索引 0；旋转插值使用归一化角差。\n\nEvaluateStack → BlendStack：从栈底 View 开始，逐层 View::Blend(UpperView, UpperWeight)。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 1026,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "offset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. CameraComponent 在合成 View 之后施加局部位置/FOV 微调，Alpha 按进入/回落时间线性变化。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "write",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "8. 写回组件与 FMinimalViewInfo；ControlRotation 单独写回 Pawn Controller。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fallback",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "无有效类且活动栈为空：直接调用 UCameraComponent::GetCameraView。",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "pull",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "pool",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "PushCameraMode(Class)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "pool",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "contribution",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "实例池复用 / NewObject"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "contribution",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "bottom",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "首模式 SetBlendWeight(1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "contribution",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "update",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "SetBlendWeight → UpdateStack"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "update",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "prune",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "权重更新 → 裁剪隐藏项"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "prune",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "blend",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "活跃栈 → BlendStack"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "blend",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "offset",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "BlendStack → 合成 View"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "fromNode": "offset",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "write",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Offset → GetCameraView 输出"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "fromNode": "pull",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "fallback",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "无有效模式 → Super::GetCameraView"
    }
  ]
}
